   "status": "MISMATCH",
   "ruling": "Ruling: refusal located elsewhere; a qualified disaster distribution made in 2025 is reported on its 2025 Form 1099-R, and each Form 1099-R record asks retirement.disaster ('Did you take this money out, or put money back, because of a federally declared disaster (Form 8915-F)?'), an operand of retirement.special, which refuses the return (forms/2025/retirement.yaml). scope.disaster_distribution covers only what has no 2025 Form 1099-R: a 2023 or 2024 distribution whose tax is spread into 2025 or that is repaid in 2025 (i8915f, qualified 2021 or later disasters). No 2025 distribution goes unrefused; no wording change.",
